299 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Petroleum price forecasting is essential for industries such as transportation, aviation, logistics, manufacturing, and energy production. Even small fluctuations in crude oil prices can significantly affect operational costs and national economies. Accurate short-term forecasts help organizations plan budgets, manage risks, and formulate pricing strategies. This study provides valuable insights into crude oil price behaviour and demonstrates the effectiveness of statistical modeling in forecasting complex real-world data.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
